{'symbol': 'TROW', 'date': '2023-02-07 13:17:00', 'title': 'T. ROWE PRICE GROUP DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': '37TH CONSECUTIVE ANNUAL DIVIDEND INCREASE BALTIMORE , FEB. 7, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- T. ROWE PRICE GROUP, INC.\xa0(NASDAQ-GS: TROW), ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF\xa0$1.22\xa0PER SHARE PAYABLE\xa0MARCH 30, 2023, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON\xa0MARCH 15, 2023.'}